# The image's build context is the repository root. Docker reads this file
# by name (<Containerfile>.dockerignore beside the Containerfile); podman and
# buildah get it with --ignorefile (make container). The Containerfile copies
# the whole context, so this list is the only allow-list: it admits the
# website's files by kind (every carino-* shared file, whatever new one
# desktop/stage.sh adds), and packaging/containerignore_test.go checks that
# every item stage.sh copies is let in.
*
!index.html
!css/
!js/
!fonts/
!vendor/
!carino-*.js
!carino-*.css
!logo*.svg
!logo*.webp
!LICENSE
!desktop/stage.sh
!server/
server/dist/
server/web/dist/
**/.*
